 Even if you see it, go ahead, unwrap it.

10
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:29,070
 You'll see.

11
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:29,910
 Never guess.

12
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:30,810
 - What?

13
