 You mean it? The greatest ever?

41
00:01:46,610 --> 00:01:49,680
 Yes, because he did begin very young.

42
00:01:50,010 --> 00:01:52,890
 He had so many ideas, even when he was just a small child.

43
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:56,090
 It was very clear he had an insatiable curiosity.

44
00:01:56,350 --> 00:01:59,110
 Mom, why does a goose sit on her eggs?

45
00:01:59,650 --> 00:02:00,980
 To keep them warm.

46
